<h1>Wandering Chef Feats</h1>

<div class="article-list">
  <a class="article-card" href="{{ 'wandering-chef-dedication' | articleUrl(collections.articles) | url }}">
    <h3>Wandering Chef Dedication</h3>
    <p class="article-summary">The Wandering Chef's dedication, revised to use food packets and Quick Cooking in place of versatile vials and Quick Alchemy.</p>
  </a>
  <a class="article-card" href="{{ 'alchemical-cooking' | articleUrl(collections.articles) | url }}">
    <h3>Alchemical Cooking</h3>
    <p class="article-summary">A skill feat, given by the Wandering Chef Dedication, that lets you Craft alchemical foods and gives you four food formulas.</p>
  </a>
  <a class="article-card" href="{{ 'quick-cooking' | articleUrl(collections.articles) | url }}">
    <h3>Quick Cooking</h3>
    <p class="article-summary">The Wandering Chef's version of Quick Alchemy: Create Food or Create Processed Food, which spend a food packet to make alchemical food.</p>
  </a>
  <a class="article-card" href="{{ 'morning-side-dishes' | articleUrl(collections.articles) | url }}">
    <h3>Morning Side Dishes</h3>
    <p class="article-summary">A Wandering Chef feat that grants the Advanced Cooking feature, which lets you prepare 5 alchemical foods during your daily preparations, like the Alchemist's Advanced Alchemy.</p>
  </a>
  <a class="article-card" href="{{ 'flash-cook' | articleUrl(collections.articles) | url }}">
    <h3>Flash Cook</h3>
    <p class="article-summary">A Wandering Chef feat that adds a Flash Cook option to Quick Cooking, turning a spare scrap of food into a Food Projectile you can fling at enemies.</p>
  </a>
  <a class="article-card" href="{{ 'additional-servings' | articleUrl(collections.articles) | url }}">
    <h3>Additional Servings</h3>
    <p class="article-summary">A Wandering Chef feat that raises the number of food packets you create each day, up to 7.</p>
  </a>
  <a class="article-card" href="{{ 'food-fight' | articleUrl(collections.articles) | url }}">
    <h3>Food Fight</h3>
    <p class="article-summary">A Wandering Chef feat that lets you Flash Cook and Strike in a single action, and makes your Food Projectiles hit harder and reach farther.</p>
  </a>
  <a class="article-card" href="{{ 'kitchen-armaments' | articleUrl(collections.articles) | url }}">
    <h3>Kitchen Armaments</h3>
    <p class="article-summary">A Wandering Chef feat that trains you in the chef's knife, cleaver, tenderizer, skewer, rolling pin, and frying pan, and unlocks their critical specialization effects.</p>
  </a>
</div>
